{
  "title": "ML-Spec: machine learning for electronic couplings from two-dimensional electronic spectra",
  "upload_type": "software",
  "description": "<p>Machine learning for extracting molecular electronic couplings from two-dimensional electronic spectra (2DES). ML-Spec is the versioned public code for the Schultz Lab's ML spectroscopy papers; each paper cites the release it used. It continues the code published with Schultz, Parker, Sbaiti and Beratan, Digital Discovery 2025, 4, 1912&ndash;1924, whose history it keeps.</p>",
